Title: Don't Stop Believin'
Artist: Journey
Key: E major
Tempo: 120
Time: 4/4

# Two four-bar loops, one bar to a chord: E B C#m A for the verses, and
# E B G#m A for the pre-chorus lift — they differ in one bar out of four, which
# is a real test of whether the clustering can tell two sections apart on a
# single chord.
#
# The title chorus arrives **once**, at 3:20, over A A E B. A form that is right
# about everything else and invents an early chorus is wrong about the one thing
# this song is famous for.

